  7 │ //! via `callisto_vcs::GitRepository` (gix) or, when gix is unavailable --
  8 │ //! permanently the case on `wasm32`, where each `CommandRunner` round-trip
  9 │ //! is a full Extism guest<->host context switch -- via a `CommandRunner`-
