//! Central native-`gix`-first, `CommandRunner`-shell-fallback selection
//! logic for [`GitDataSource`], replacing the `if let Ok(repo) = ... { if
//! let Ok(x) = repo.op(...) { return x } } /* fall through */` boilerplate
